<p>I wanna like this but&#8230; eh. I get the idea of wanting to build escalation up to nothing, but im kind of lost on that &quot;what the fuck?&quot; feeling, more just doesnt make sense. The anomalies are strange but it does feel very parawatchy as in like&#8230; this could be real maybe? It's a realistic anomalous. It's wierd. And the more I type about this the more I start to like it to the point of wanting to novote at least, but I'm not going to edit the rest of the stuff i just typed, because it shows my thought process.</p>
<p>And here I am, about to submit, and I just reread it again, and I think I like it a lot? So I'm giving a hesitant upvote. The images really help, because its just pure spooky, and I love that vibe from images.</p>
<p>In all, this SCP is really conflicting with my standards, and it's hard to get some solid thoughts on it for me. But I think I like it? I'm not sure. My vote might change later.</p>
<p>edit: upon some rethinking and another reread, I've swapped to a novote.</p>

